{"avertissement":"Fiches de DEMONSTRATION. Groupes et maisons fictifs, chiffres tires dans les bandes de la distinction visee. Aucun groupe reel, aucune maison reelle, aucun chiffre reel.","note_taux":"Le classement et le filtre par investissement se font sur une valeur de reference en euros (taux figes). Chaque maison s'affiche dans la devise de son pays.","note_honoraires":"Les honoraires de base portent sur le chiffre d'affaires TOTAL, les honoraires d'incitation sur le RESULTAT BRUT D'EXPLOITATION, la redevance sur le chiffre d'affaires HEBERGEMENT seul. Ces trois pourcentages ne s'additionnent pas et ne se comparent pas entre eux.","distinctions":[{"cle":"palace","fr":"Palace urbain","en":"City palace","desc_fr":"Grande adresse de centre-ville : restauration signee, salons de reception, spa complet, service continu.","desc_en":"Landmark city address: signature dining, function salons, full spa, round-the-clock service."},{"cle":"maison","fr":"Maison de luxe","en":"Luxury house","desc_fr":"Petite unite, moins de cent cles, ou le personnel connait le nom du client avant son arrivee.","desc_en":"A small property, under one hundred keys, where the staff know the guest's name before arrival."},{"cle":"resort","fr":"Resort de prestige","en":"Prestige resort","desc_fr":"Bord de mer ou montagne, sejours longs, plusieurs tables, activites et clientele familiale haut de gamme.","desc_en":"Seaside or mountain, longer stays, several restaurants, activities and high-end family clientele."},{"cle":"domaine","fr":"Domaine et demeure historique","en":"Estate and historic house","desc_fr":"Chateau, manoir ou domaine viticole converti : le batiment est le produit, et il impose ses contraintes.","desc_en":"A converted chateau, manor or wine estate: the building is the product, and it sets the constraints."},{"cle":"design","fr":"Lifestyle de prestige","en":"Prestige lifestyle","desc_fr":"Adresse d'auteur : architecture signee, bar de destination, programmation culturelle, clientele plus jeune.","desc_en":"A design-led address: named architecture, destination bar, cultural programme, younger clientele."}],"modes":[{"cle":"gestion","fr":"Contrat de gestion","en":"Management contract","base_fr":"Honoraires de base sur le chiffre d'affaires total, plus honoraires d'incitation sur le resultat brut d'exploitation","base_en":"Base fee on total revenue, plus incentive fee on gross operating profit","desc_fr":"Le groupe exploite la maison pour le compte du proprietaire : il recrute le directeur general, engage les equipes, tient les comptes d'exploitation. Le proprietaire porte l'actif et le resultat.","desc_en":"The group operates the house on the owner's behalf: it appoints the general manager, hires the teams and runs the operating accounts. The owner carries the asset and the result."},{"cle":"affiliation","fr":"Affiliation a une collection","en":"Collection affiliation","base_fr":"Redevance sur le chiffre d'affaires hebergement, plus frais de distribution","base_en":"Royalty on rooms revenue, plus distribution fees","desc_fr":"La maison GARDE SON NOM et son equipe, et rejoint une collection qui lui apporte la distribution, la clientele fidelisee et la caution. C'est la porte d'entree des proprietaires independants.","desc_en":"The house KEEPS ITS OWN NAME and team, and joins a collection that brings distribution, a loyal clientele and endorsement. This is the usual route for independent owners."},{"cle":"franchise","fr":"Franchise de marque","en":"Brand franchise","base_fr":"Redevance sur le chiffre d'affaires hebergement","base_en":"Royalty on rooms revenue","desc_fr":"Le proprietaire exploite lui-meme sous la marque. Rare a ce niveau de gamme, et reserve aux exploitants qui ont deja une direction hoteliere en propre.","desc_en":"The owner operates under the brand. Rare at this level, and reserved for owners who already have their own hotel management."},{"cle":"location","fr":"Bail","en":"Lease","base_fr":"Loyer fixe ou indexe sur le chiffre d'affaires","base_en":"Fixed or revenue-indexed rent","desc_fr":"Le groupe loue les murs et exploite a ses risques. Le proprietaire percoit un loyer et sort de l'exploitation.","desc_en":"The group leases the building and operates at its own risk. The owner receives a rent and steps out of operations."}],"prestations":[{"cle":"direction","fr":"Direction generale et encadrement","en":"General manager and senior team"},{"cle":"chef","fr":"Chef executif et concept de restauration","en":"Executive chef and dining concept"},{"cle":"conciergerie","fr":"Conciergerie et service d'etage continu","en":"Concierge and 24-hour in-room service"},{"cle":"distribution","fr":"Distribution luxe et agences de voyages de prestige","en":"Luxury distribution and prestige travel agencies"},{"cle":"reconnaissance","fr":"Programme de reconnaissance client","en":"Guest recognition programme"},{"cle":"tarifaire","fr":"Gestion tarifaire et prevision de la demande","en":"Revenue management and demand forecasting"},{"cle":"spa","fr":"Concept de spa et de bien-etre","en":"Spa and wellness concept"},{"cle":"arts","fr":"Arts de la table et approvisionnement","en":"Tableware and sourcing"},{"cle":"architecture","fr":"Direction artistique et suivi d'architecture","en":"Art direction and architectural supervision"},{"cle":"preouverture","fr":"Equipe de pre-ouverture et recrutement","en":"Pre-opening team and recruitment"},{"cle":"residences","fr":"Commercialisation des residences de marque","en":"Branded residences sales"}],"pays":[{"cle":"CA","fr":"Canada","en":"Canada","region":"na","devise":"CAD"},{"cle":"US","fr":"Etats-Unis","en":"United States","region":"na","devise":"USD"},{"cle":"FR","fr":"France","en":"France","region":"eu-ouest","devise":"EUR"},{"cle":"BE","fr":"Belgique","en":"Belgium","region":"eu-ouest","devise":"EUR"},{"cle":"NL","fr":"Pays-Bas","en":"Netherlands","region":"eu-ouest","devise":"EUR"},{"cle":"DE","fr":"Allemagne","en":"Germany","region":"eu-ouest","devise":"EUR"},{"cle":"A